    "Install sim-use": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalar sim-use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can’t be allowed on its own: these settings unblock everything else. Only god mode unblocks it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede permitir sola: desde estos ajustes se libera todo lo demás. Solo el modo dios la libera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is stored in the Keychain and passed to Claude Code when the MCP is registered in the next step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se guarda en el Llavero y se le pasa a Claude Code al registrar el MCP en el paso siguiente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its settings hold these switches: only god mode unblocks it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sus ajustes tienen estos switches: solo el modo dios la libera."
