    "Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TYPESAFE_API_KEY": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objetivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tests": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pruebas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tests the MCP saves with connect(test:) appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las pruebas que guarda el MCP con connect(test:) aparecen aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tests…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pruebas…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MCP doesn’t drive these apps: typing into them can run commands or expose secrets. Turn one on to allow it and reconnect with `/mcp`: the MCP reads the allowed apps only at launch, so an injected instruction can’t unblock them mid-session by editing the settings. Apps you don’t have installed don’t appear and stay blocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El MCP no maneja estas apps: escribir en ellas puede correr comandos o exponer secretos. Prendé una para permitirla y reconectá con `/mcp`: el MCP lee las permitidas solo al arrancar, para que una instrucción inyectada no pueda liberarlas a mitad de sesión editando los ajustes. Las que no tenés instaladas no aparecen y siguen bloqueadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next steps check that everything is ready to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En los próximos pasos verificamos que esté todo listo para usarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La grabación falló."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pensando…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This test has no recording.mov.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta prueba no tiene recording.mov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on god mode?": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Activar el modo dios?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unblocks every app on this list, Fingertip included. Changing it registers the server again; then reconnect with `/mcp`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Libera todas las apps de esta lista, Fingertip incluida. Cambiarlo vuelve a registrar el servidor; después reconectá con `/mcp`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unreadable test.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "test.json ilegible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actualizaciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating the app also updates the `fingertip-mcp` it ships with: reconnect with `/mcp`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al actualizarse la app también se actualiza el `fingertip-mcp` que trae: reconectá con `/mcp`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usar la predeterminada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by `run_instruction`. It is stored in the Keychain and passed along when the MCP is registered: if you change it, install again from General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La usa `run_instruction`. Se guarda en el Llavero y se pasa al registrar el MCP: si la cambiás, volvé a instalar desde General."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versión %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vista"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Fingertip": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenido a Fingertip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ventanas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a key, every other tool works the same. If you don’t have one, skip this step; you can add it later in Settings → Jev.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin clave, todas las demás tools funcionan igual. Si no tenés una, seguí de largo; podés cargarla después en Ajustes → Jev."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode and iOS runtimes": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode y runtimes de iOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode has no iOS runtimes: add them in Xcode → Settings → Components.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode no tiene runtimes de iOS: agregalos en Xcode → Settings → Components."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll only use macOS apps, so none of this is needed. You can come back to this step from the menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo vas a usar apps de macOS: no hace falta nada de esto. Podés volver a este paso desde el menú."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`brew %@` failed (%d): %@": {
